From: gargrohin <29701609+gargrohin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 06:59:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Flux3_Action: eval adapter for a FLUX 3 Action RoboTwin
 policy

Serves a flux-action inference export (EMA 0.10, bf16) through the XPolicyLab
policy server. Per query it hands FluxActionPolicy.predict_action_chunk the
observation in the training batch format (head and wrist cameras resized to the
trainer's 360x640 with the policy's own resize, 14-D state, instruction) and
returns the 32 absolute joint targets as GR00T_N17-style per-step dicts.
Sampling: flux-action's DROID reference inference settings, one noise seed per
query as its RoboLab server.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
